":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787438128512304001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9dd7958f-cbc9-4d55-a06a-b63aca5e67da","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9c72-c44a-3421-45ad"}],"description":"## Origin\nExtracted from decision register twofaced-paralytic-elk (9c72-c44a-3421-45ad), which is being dissolved into per-item tickets. Source bug: silt-resistant-gonolek (b0a8-5496-d178-40a9, closed) — standalone concurrency loader cannot import git adapter.\n\n## Decision required (verbatim from the register)\nRaw package-free execution of private `_concurrency.py` regressed at d9e0f0e733 and now raises `ModuleNotFoundError`, but every supported production/library/subprocess route establishes `rebar_reconciler` package context before `applier._load_concurrency()` and succeeds; the caller census found no other route and canonical adapter identity is already singular. Exact decision: must every location-pinned/by-file-loaded reconciler module execute without package context, or only modules that explicitly declare and bootstrap a standalone contract? Recommendation: require context-free execution only for explicitly bootstrapped standalone modules. 'Location-pinned' in ADR 0083 describes filesystem coupling, not a public entry-point promise; `_concurrency.py` is private, says it is inert on its own, and cannot be reached through applier without package context. Under this choice, classify silt-resistant-gonolek as `misunderstanding` / not-a-bug and close without code. If the operator instead wants universal context-free execution, approve that as a new package-wide contract and resume that ticket with the canonical dotted `lazy_load` repair plus an explicit contract test.\n\n## Status\nAwaits an operator design ruling; held at `idea` until ruled.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"b0b09d4e-4a4b-45de-99f5-e0611a3fe8fd","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":["decision-register","debug-sweep"],"ticket_id":"e5ea-12f3-177b-485a","ticket_type":"task","title":"Design ruling: package-context contract for location-pinned reconciler modules (_concurrency.py)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["7b185627-b27d-46e3-a75f-d3111d2c8065","b0b09d4e-4a4b-45de-99f5-e0611a3fe8fd","9dd7958f-cbc9-4d55-a06a-b63aca5e67da"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787443630387055029,"uuid":"3a84fa82-3a3d-4b67-9aa2-824277cde515"}